 *
 * The includer must define BMX_REMOTE_CONTROL(key, id) and
 * BMX_REMOTE_ACTION(key, id). Machine-specific IDs are intentionally kept in
 * this single table: menu_control skips bindings whose live item is absent.
 * Dynamic dialogs such as MENU_CALC_TIMING are not public REST actions.
 */

